skills. Start with basic movements and attacks, then evolve your arsenal by meeting various mentors. The bosses are unforgiving—victory requires precision and strategy. Can the Prince endure and save his kingdom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Groggy System through Purification</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HaeTae is the ultimate symbol of purification. By landing HaeTae’s skills on corrupted bosses or elite monsters, you can trigger a <strong>Groggy</strong> state. Master HaeTae’s timing to create windows of devastating opportunity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/332a3f13ba6ae5c916f791546911800e.poster.avif?t=1781258468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/332a3f13ba6ae5c916f791546911800e.webm?t=1781258468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/332a3f13ba6ae5c916f791546911800e.mp4?t=1781258468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Boss Challenge: The Trials Never End</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a boss is just the beginning. Test your limits in <strong>Boss Trials</strong>, featuring tougher conditions and environmental hazards. Overcome new rules and monster combinations to achieve high scores and earn rare relics as rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/37de6cb9b52d4f46c4ff52da2994388c.poster.avif?t=1781258468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste