pps/2854210/extras/f90dc6ef08e31781c847fc914a578ce8.poster.avif?t=1781258468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/f90dc6ef08e31781c847fc914a578ce8.webm?t=1781258468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/f90dc6ef08e31781c847fc914a578ce8.mp4?t=1781258468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Essences: HaeTae’s Infinite Evolution</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a boss grants you their Essence. These Essences can be used to fundamentally change HaeTae’s abilities. Switch between Essences anytime to experiment with different synergies. Will you focus on explosive firepower, or choose to outmaneuver your enemies with sheer agility?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/b1b6c40746eb20476d69bcf8ac8feb8f.poster.avif?t=1781258468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/b1b6c40746eb20476d69bcf8ac8feb8f.webm?t=1781258468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/b1b6c40746eb20476d69bcf8ac8feb8f.mp4?t=1781258468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relic Collection</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire Relics by defeating elite monsters or conquering Boss Trials. Relics grant the Prince special powers, and <strong>Set Bonuses</strong> can exponentially increase the capabilities of both the Prince and HaeTae. Combine them with Secret Manuals to test diverse performance builds and find the strongest combination!<